ming area in property development. With its style and design, this property appeals to young adults, home buyers and professionals.\nL200: This property was developed by Trinity Group Sdn Bhd as they hope to set a benchmark with this new concept of integrated developments while giving their customers quality. Residents of this apartment can enjoy view of the city and mountain, and the apartments in this property have air conditioners. There is wardrobe in the bedroom and the kitchen is well equipped with a stovetop, microwave, refrigerator and there is also kitchenware.\nL201: There is a flat screen TV, sofa, desk, dining table which shows that this apartment is well furnished. It has a dryer and a washing machine. This property has a good connection to roads and also quite a good number of amenities are also around it.\nL202: Facilities that are featured in this property includes a 50m Olympic size infinity pool, restaurant, clubhouse, landscaped garden, nursery, lounge, barbeque area, covered car park, multi-purpose hall, children’s pool, sauna, party deck, 3 tier sky terrace, floating Gymnasium and a caf&eacute;. There is sky club which has an internet station, sky bar, food and beverage outlet and also a library.\nL203: This property also has a 4 tier security system which includes guards, card access at the lift lobby and car park and CCTV Surveillance. The parking lots for commercial and residential zones are well separated as the smart card system allows vehicles to only designated areas.\nL204: This property can be accessed easily via South Klang Valley Expressway (SKVE), Kuala Lumpur-Putrajaya Highway, Damansara Puchong Expressway (LDP), Besraya Highway (BESRAYA), Persiaran Lestari Perdana, North-South Expressway (NSE) and Maju Expressway (MEX). Accessibility to the city center will be made easier with the link from Maju Expressway and Serdang-Kinrara-Putrajaya Highway (SKIP). The closest airports to this property are Sultan Abdul Aziz Shah Airport and Kuala Lumpur International Airport.\nL205: Bus stops nearby in the case of public transportation. Some of the amenities that are around this property are educational institutions with the likes of Limkokwing University of Creative technology, Equestrian Royal Academy, Multimedia Malaysia University, Wendy Montessori Pre School, University Tenaga Nasional (UNITEN) Alice Smith International School and University Putra Malaysia.\nL206: Clinics/hospitals in the area include Goodcare Pharmacy, H Pharma Pharmacy Sdn Bhd, Health Lane family Pharmacy, Putra Pharmacy, and Family choice pharmacy, Hospital Putrajaya, Hospital Serdang and National Cancer Institute of Malaysia. Just opposite this apartment is Putra walk and AEON Jusco.\nL207: There is also GIANT Hypermart, The Mines Shopping Mall and Resort, Alamanda Shopping Mall, Unigro Enterprise, MyMydin Putra Walk, and Pasar Raya Syed Kamamngin, Evolve Concept mall, IOI City Mall, Pavilion Kuala Lumpur are malls and shopping outlets that are around this property. RHB Bank, ATM Affin Bank, CIMB ATM machine and Ogawa @ AEON Equine Park are ATMs in the area.\nL208: There are some restaurants like Iron Chef House, Shushi King Equine Park, Sushi King, 3 Lautan, Pizza Hut Equine Park, KFC AEON Equine Park, McDonald’s Taman Equine and Old town white coffee. Klaut Resources, Kuala Lumpur City Center, Bukit National Stadium and Equine Basketball Court are also in the vicinity. The land area of this property is 3.71acres, and it has 766 units which are contained in 3 different blocks.\nL209: Block A is 15 storeys high and has 210 units; block B is also 15 storeys high and has 236 units, while block C is 20 storeys high and it has 320 units. These units are have two different design layouts. Type A which is a studio type has a built up space of 455 square feet – 638 square feet while type B which comes with either two or three bedrooms has a built up space of 881 sqaure feet - 1,536 square feet.\nL210: There is also a retail area which has 12 Boutique retail units which are 3 – 4 storeys high and the built up space is from 5,703 square feet to 12,230 square feet. Each of the retail units has its own lift. This property was completed in the year 2005. The prices of the units in Blocks A and B starts from RM 350,000 while for the units in Block C which are studio unit, the prices starts from RM 220,000.\nL211: The prices of the retail units starts from RM 2.8 million.Project Name: Zeva @ Equine SouthConfiguration: 210 residential unitsThe following projects are by the same developer as Zeva @ Equine South:The Z residenceThe Zest @ Kinrara 9The Heron ResidencyTrinity AquataTrinity PentamontThe following developments are in the same neighbourhood as Zeva @ Equine South:Villa ParkUniv 360 PlaceAman HeightsVista ImpianaSerdang Skyvillas (Serdang Perdana)3 Elements @ Seri Kembangan\nL212: cite64†View project details L213: \nL214: cite65†Verified YEN KEE LIONG CHESTER PROPERTIES SDN. BHD. [ E (1) 1321 ]REN: 04537 verified LPPEH-registered number is OTP-verified L215: \nL216: WhatsApp\nL217: \nL218: cite66†Image†cdn.pgimgs.com L219: \nL220: View Phone Number\nL221: \nL222: cite67†Image†cdn.pgimgs.com L223: \nL224: Send Enquiry\nL225: ## FAQs\nL226: \nL227: ##### How much does it cost to rent a unit in Taman Pinggiran Putra, Seri Kembangan?\nL228: \nL229: The monthly rental in Taman Pinggiran Putra, Seri Kembangan is RM 850 /mo.\nL230: \nL231: ##### Is security available at Zeva @ Equine South?\nL232: \nL233: Yes (24-hour security).\nL234: \nL235: ##### Where is this unit located?\nL236: \nL237: Jalan Putra Permai, Taman Pinggiran Putra, Seri Kembangan, Selangor.\nL238: ##### What should I know before renting a place in Taman Pinggiran Putra, Seri Kembangan?\nL239: \nL240: Here is a cite68†guide to rent a property in Malaysia including security deposit and understanding the importance of cite68†tenancy agreement .\nL241: \nL242: ##### When was this unit completed?\nL243: \nL244: The completi